Plate blocks can hold other blocks by declaring a `container` in their plugin options: the blocks it allows, whether it can be nested, what happens to it where it is not allowed, and schema enhancers for the blocks inside it. `getBlockConfig(editor, type, { at })` resolves the config of a Plone block with those overrides, and the slash menu only offers the blocks the container holds. The accordion uses it. @Humanaice
